DESCRIPTION:Rocky Horror Picture Show\nThe Bawdy Caste performs a full sha
 dow cast of The Rocky Horror Picture Show\, acting out the movie in front 
 of the screen while it plays with audience participation. Expect singing\,
  dancing\, costumes\, callbacks and a room full of people ready to celebra
 te. Callbacks are the shouted responses that Rocky Horror audiences have t
 raded with the screen for 50 years. Don’t worry if you don’t know them
  yet — the crowd will teach you. Dressing up is encouraged.\nOfficial pa
 rticipation kits\, Bawdy Bags\, available for purchase for $5. These inclu
 de everything you need to throw\, blow\, and glow during the show. You may
  bring props\, but no wet items\, meat\, rice\, toast\, glitter\, confetti
 \, or anything that could make a mess or attract critters.\nDoors at 5 p.m
 .\; film starts at 5:45 p.m.\n\nBawdy Caste\, a registered 501(c)(3) nonpr
 ofit\, has been San Francisco’s Rocky Horror Shadowcast for three decade
 s. Their performances are based in SF and can be found across the Bay and 
 beyond.\nConnect: Bawdy Caste – website | Bawdy Caste – Instagram | Ba
 wdy Caste – Facebook\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://sfpl.org/events/2026/10
 /21/film-rocky-horror-picture-show-full-shadow-cast\nDetails: https://sf.f
 uncheap.com/rocky-horror-picture-show-full-shadow-cast-sf-main-library-2/\
 nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Rocky-
 Horror-Lips.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Koret Auditorium\, 100 Larkin St\, San Francisco\, CA 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/rocky-horror-picture-show-full-shadow-cast-sf-
 main-library-2/
