 et/34913488/168a9963-ef96-4184-ac7d-d4abcaa5b8c0.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T120138Z
LOCATION:The Church of Mother Gong\, 1345 Grant Ave\, San Francisco\, CA\,
   94133
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/21/free-movie-night-satanic-hippie
 s-lsd-and-rabid-meat-pies-tickets
