DESCRIPTION:What happens when a super-villain origin story gets a serious 
 horror-movie makeover? CLAYFACE\, that’s what. Director James Watkins (T
 HE WOMAN IN BLACK) brings a nasty dose of body horror to Gotham\, with DOC
 TOR SLEEP and Midnight Mass mastermind Mike Flanagan on co-writing duties.
  Tom Rhys Harries stars as Matt Hagen\, a disfigured actor who undergoes a
  miraculous transformation that sends his grip on reality\, and his appeti
 te for revenge\, somewhere very dark. Get ready to face your fears on the 
 big screen.\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/22/clayface-ti
 ckets\nSource: DoTheBay
