BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:B-Movie: Lust & Sound in West-Berlin
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T200000
DTSTAMP:20261018T205153Z
UID:funcheap-1642337@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:© DEF Media GmbHJoin us for a filmscreening of B-Movie: Lust 
 & Sound in West-Berlin:\nHoping to follow in the footsteps of legends like
  David Bowie and CAN\, Manchester punk rocker and early electronic music a
 colyte Mark Reeder arrives in a divided Berlin in 1979. Luckily\, he films
  everything he sees: black leather-clad teenagers\, giant pink and red hai
 rdos\, gritty basement gigs\, and a parade of the scene’s most illustrio
 us figures\, including Nick Cave\, Mania D’s Gudrun Gut\, and Einstürze
 nde Neubauten’s Blixa Bargeld. From the movement’s system-smashing hig
 hs to its waning years in the age of reunification\, Reeder is the outside
 r with an insider’s view of the beating heart of Germany’s underground
  cultural life.\nLovingly assembled from a decade of fascinating film and 
 audio material\, B-Movie: Lust & Sound in West-Berlin provides a fast-pace
 d but no less intimate look at Berlin’s punk and electronic subculture t
 hrough the eyes of one of its greatest devotees. Winner of the Heiner Caro
 w Prize at the 2015 Berlin International Film Festival.\n\nWith Mark Reede
