DESCRIPTION:An audacious comedic fable about sex\, marriage\, and the absu
 rdities of social convention\, WICKER tells the wholly original love story
  of an ostracized fisherwoman (Olivia Colman) who commissions a husband to
  be made by the local basketmaker (Peter Dinklage). When her wicker husban
 d (Alexander Skarsgård) proves more spectacular than she ever imagined\, 
 his soulful spirit and unique prowess awaken something inside her\, settin
 g off a wave of jealousy\, fascination\, and upheaval that threatens the v
 ery fabric of village life.\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/1
 0/23/wicker-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
