UID:funcheap-1643579@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerThe Tech InteractiveThe saga e
 nds. The IMAX experience is just beginning. Return to Arrakis for the brea
 thtaking conclusion of Denis Villeneuve’s epic trilogy. [Dune: Part Thre
 e](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y_1ioNxTc1U&t=73s) arrives at The Tech 
 Interactive’s IMAX® Dome Theater\, bringing one of cinema’s most ambi
 tious science fiction stories to life on the largest dome screen in the Ba
 y Area. Nearly two decades have passed since Paul Atreides (Timothée Chal
 amet) seized control of the Imperium. Now a ruthless emperor\, Paul faces 
 the consequences of his reign as old allies return\, new enemies emerge\, 
 and betrayal threatens everything he has built. Haunted by visions of a co
 llapsing empire and the return of his long-lost love\, Paul must confront 
 a dangerous conspiracy with Chani (Zendaya) at its center. Power comes at 
 a price. And the fate of an empire hangs in the balance. Filmed for IMAX. 
 Made to Be Experienced. Director Denis Villeneuve envisioned the Dune tril
 ogy for IMAX from the beginning. For the first time in the franchise\, Dun
 e: Part Three was filmed using a combination of IMAX-certified digital cam
 eras and IMAX Film Cameras\, capturing extraordinary detail and scale. Wit
 h 71 minutes featuring IMAX’s exclusive expanded aspect ratio and a spec
 ially optimized sound mix\, this final chapter was crafted to pull audienc
 es deeper into the world of Arrakis. **Why See It at The Tech Interactive?
 ** – **A world beyond the ordinary**: Experience s...\n\n$20.00\n\nTicke
 ts: https://eventvesta.com/events/169380/t/tickets\nDetails: https://sf.fu
 ncheap.com/dune-part-imax-san-jose/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/image-
 2026-10-21T071746.653.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261025T163045Z
LOCATION:The Tech Interactive\, 201 S. Market St. San Jose California
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/dune-part-imax-san-jose/
END:VEVENT
