UID:funcheap-1639790@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerAlliance française de San Fra
 nciscoHave a good time enjoying a thrilling movie\, while improving your F
 rench! All movies will be screened in French with English subtitles.\nSyno
 psis: No fewer than three men and 40 animals have been found dead on the b
 eaches of Brittany. The killer’s identity is an open secret: green algae
 . Inès Léraud was still a young journalist when\, driven by an environme
 ntal conscience\, she decided to move to Brittany to investigate this phen
 omenon. Through her encounters with whistleblowers\, scientists\, farmers\
 , and politicians\, she unravels\, not without difficulty\, half a century
  of manufactured silence: samples disappearing in laboratories\, bodies bu
 ried before autopsies\, power plays\, pressure tactics… Will the truth p
 revail?\n\nDirector: Pierre Jolivet\nMain cast: Céline Sallette\, Nina Me
 urisse\, Julie Ferrier\nWhen? Tuesday\, October 27th\, 6:00pm – 8:00pm\n
 Where? Alliance Française de San Francisco\, 1345 Bush Street\, San Franc
 isco\, CA 94109\nWho? All levels are welcome! Plus on est de fous\, plus o
 n rit!\nHow much? $10\, $5 for members\nE-mail louise@afsf.com for any que
 stions.\n\n$10.00\n\nTickets: https://www.afsf.com/event-rsvp/movie-night-
 les-algues-vertes-october-27th-2026/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/fre
 nch-thriller-night-les-algues-vertes-english-subtitles-sf/\nSource: Funche
 ap SF
