DESCRIPTION:Practical Magic 2 Movie Night\nThursday\, October 29 | Oracle 
 Park\n\nThe Owens Sisters arrive on the largest screen in San Francisco fo
 r one night only. Join us at Oracle Park on Thursday\, October 29 for a sp
 ecial Halloween screening of the Warner Bros. film PRACTICAL MAGIC 2\, the
  highly anticipated sequel to the beloved modern classic.\n\nPurchase tick
 ets early to guarantee your spot at this spellbinding event!\n\nDoors open
  at 6:00 p.m. and the film begins promptly at 7:30 p.m. Tickets are $28. A
 ll tickets are general admission with the option to sit directly on the fi
 eld or in Lower Box seats. Seating is first-come\, first-served.\n\nA Magi
 cal Night: The screening will also feature a candlelit red carpet\, photo 
 opportunities\, Midnight Margaritas\, trick-or-treating for kids\, and mor
 e.\n\nAll ticket holders will enjoy access to the following amenities:\n\n
 Candlelit Red Carpet: Walk the red carpet like a celebrity and snap a pict
 ure in front of the Practical Magic 2 backdrop lined with candles and spoo
 ky décor.\nThemed Food & Beverage: Enjoy a variety of ballpark fan-favori
 te fare for purchase\, including an exclusive one-day menu of film-inspire
 d items.\nMidnight Margarita Bar: Snag the witchy cocktail in both classic
  and frozen varieties. Non-alcoholic themed drinks will also be available.
 \nThe Magic of Scent: Step into a world of enchanting aromas before the ma
 gic hits the big screen. San Francisco’s own Ministry of Scent brings yo
 u an immersive\, sensory experience of Witchy Winter Wears fe...\n\n$28\, 
 All Ages\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://www.sfgiants.com/practi
 calmagic\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/29/practical-magic-
 2-movie-night-at-oracle-park-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\
 n- https://sf.funcheap.com/practical-magic-movie-oracle-park/
