DESCRIPTION:The Shining\, 1980 Directed by Stanley Kubrick\n\nHE CAME AS T
 HE CARETAKER\, BUT THIS HOTEL HAD ITS OWN GUARDIANS - WHOD BEEN THERE A LO
 NG TIME\n\nThough it deviates from Stephen King's novel\, Stanley Kubrick'
 s The Shining is a chilling\, often baroque journey into madness -- exempl
 ified by an unforgettable turn from Jack Nicholson.\n\nSigning a contract\
 , Jack Torrance\, a normal writer and former teacher agrees to take care o
 f a hotel which has a long\, violent past that puts everyone in the hotel 
 in a nervous situation. While Jack slowly gets more violent and angry of h
