 et/34437282/19e24993-68f3-4e61-a54c-99ccb1c23f2d.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/4/an-evening-with-jane-schoenbrun-
