BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Godzilla Minus Zero
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T180000
DTSTAMP:20261007T210655Z
UID:dothebay-17931638@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Presented in Japanese with English subtitles\n\nWar reduced Ja
 pan to zero. Godzilla plunged it into minus. Now the math gets even more t
 errifying. Takashi Yamazaki returns to direct\, write\, and oversee the vi
 sual effects for this epic follow-up to GODZILLA MINUS ONE\, his Oscar-win
 ning reinvention of Toho’s iconic monster. Set in 1949\, two years after
  the events of the previous film\, GODZILLA MINUS ZERO follows Japan’s h
 ard-fought recovery as a new catastrophe threatens to erase it all. With r
 eturning stars Ryunosuke Kamiki and Minami Hamabe\, bigger monster mayhem\
 , and spectacular effects built for a huge screen\, this is the latest cha
 pter in a storied franchise that began in 1954. See the King of the Monste
