DESCRIPTION:A dazzling showcase of dance films at the cutting edge of crea
 tivity and cinematic craft.\n\nRepresenting the very best of the festival
 ’s creative range\, Spotlight Shorts promises fresh ideas and cinematic 
 daring. This curated collection features an eclectic blend of whimsy\, lon
 ging\, and quiet comedy\, while spanning hand-drawn ink animation\, immers
 ive lighting design\, and full-scale collaborations with world-class dance
  companies. From a dancer’s reflection coming to life inside a stuck ele
 vator to a solo warm-up that blossoms into a flight of fantasy on one of t
 he world’s grandest opera house stages\, these films surprise and deligh
 t in equal measure.\n\nWith choreography from world-renowned artists Chris
 topher Stowell (Royal Winnipeg Ballet)\, Jacob Jonas (Jacob Jonas The Comp
 any)\, Medhi Walerski (Ballet BC)\, and more\, this vibrant mix of standou
 t dance films is a program not to be missed.\n\nFollowed by a reception in
  the lobby with music from DJ Glitterfox\, open to all ticket holders.\n\n
 Info and tickets: https://sfdancefilmfest.org/fall-festival-2026/spotlight
 -shorts-2026/\n\n$25-45\n2026 SF Dance Film Festival:\n\nTickets: https://
 sfdancefilmfest.org/fall-festival-2026/spotlight-shorts-2026/\nDetails: ht
 tps://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/7/spotlight-shorts-tickets\nSource: DoTh
