DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17882157@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:A music-driven night of rhythm\, soul\, and screen-shaking vis
 uals at the SHACK15 social club.\n\nGet ready for a high-energy evening wh
 ere the music takes center stage. Cue the Music at SHACK15 transforms San 
 Francisco’s iconic Ferry Building into a dynamic celebration of sound an
 d movement on screen. This year’s soundtrack spans genres and generation
 s: Grammy-winning artist Imogen Heap teams up with Pattie Gonia for a song
  about what we take for granted\, global pop icon Harry Styles scores the 
 unraveling of a relationship\, and soul revivalists Durand Jones & The Ind
 ications set the tone for a night at the club gone thrillingly off-script.
  Blues powerhouse Susan Tedeschi and a mix of rising and independent artis
 ts round out a lineup built as much for the dance floor as the screen.\n\n
 With the chance to mingle with festival filmmakers\, this is more than a f
 ilm screening — it’s a party for music lovers\, dance fans\, and anyon
 e who wants to feel the beat in their feet.\n\nInfo and tickets: https://s
 fdancefilmfest.org/fall-festival-2026/cue-the-music/\n\n25-45\n2026 SF Dan
 ce Film Festival:\n\nTickets: https://sfdancefilmfest.org/fall-festival-20
 26/cue-the-music/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/12/cue-the
 -music-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
