SUMMARY:MC5: A True Testimonial
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T210000
DTSTAMP:20261027T152452Z
UID:dothebay-17996850@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:This documentary\, made over a period of eight years\, tells t
 he remarkable story of an extremely influential rocknroll band. Starting f
 rom their mid-60s garage band roots (sounding amazingly like the Sonics)\,
  the Motor City 5 deveoped into an icon for a brand of loud\, crushing mus
 ic reflecting their industrial roots. Even if you dont care for their musi
 c (and youre bound to like even a few of their songs)\, their story is fas
 cinating. It combines 60s protest\, youthful braggadocio\, and a style of 
 music that would help carry one to the likes of Iggy and the Stooges (not 
 to mention certain aspects of punk rock). This film is clearly a labor of 
 love\, combining extraordinarily rare live shows\, still shots\, a nearly-
 continuous backdrop of MC5 tunes\, penetrating interviews with the remaini
 ng members and their spouses\, and even FBI surveillance shots. Its the ul
 timate testimonial to a band that only gains in stature as time goes on.\n
 \nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/20294?siteToken=d2a
 tbcege5knqsavntt91g1250\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/27/m
 c5-a-true-testimonial-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35137761/20596aff-e095-4676-b96c-6140972a98b6.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261027T152452Z
LOCATION:Cinema SF\, 2200 Clement Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94121 \, San
  Francisco\, CA\, 94117
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/27/mc5-a-true-testimonial-tickets
END:VEVENT
