DESCRIPTION:Don’t think ELF is one of the best holiday films ever? You s
 it on a throne of lies!\n\nChristmas movies come and go\, but few join the
  pantheon of the greats. You know the ones – A CHRISTMAS STORY\, IT'S A 
 WONDERFUL LIFE\, and MIRACLE ON 34TH STREET. These are just a few that are
  invited to sit at the adult table of holiday movies. While the last coupl
 e of decades have been pretty sparse when it comes to quality Christmas mo
 vies\, ELF\, the 2003 Will Ferrell comedy\, undoubtedly has taken a corner
  seat at this proverbial table of fame.\n\nDirected by Jon Favreau\, ELF i
 s one of those Christmas movies that's impossible to not love It's funny i
 n all the right places\, highly quotable\, and surprisingly tender. It's W
 ill Ferrell at his Ferrellist.\n\nDon't miss a full night of pointy-toed\,
  jingle bell bliss – especially if you need a pick-me-up in the holiday 
 cheer department – because attending ELF is the Christmas spirit equival
 ent of putting syrup on your spaghetti.\n\nTickets: https://drafthouse.com
 /sf/show/movie-party-elf-movie-party-sing-along?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=22
 964\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/2/elf-tickets\nSource: D
 oTheBay
