DESCRIPTION:Mele-ki-liki-maka is Hawaii's way to say Merry Christmas to yo
 u.\n\nBad luck seems to follow Clark Griswold and his family no matter whe
 re they go or what they do. The perpetual optimist\, Clark (the young and 
 great Chevy Chase) tries to make the holidays a special family event by ch
 opping down the biggest tree in the forest\, hanging a million Christmas l
 ights\, and dealing with his obnoxious visiting family members. He does th
 is all while banking on his holiday bonus – but will it come?\n\nIs NATI
 ONAL LAMPOON'S CHRISTMAS VACATION a perfect Christmas movie? Yes.\n\nTicke
 ts: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/movie-party-national-lampoons-christmas
