DESCRIPTION:The Griswolds have planned all year for a great summer vacatio
 n. From their suburban Chicago home\, across America\, to the wonders of W
 ally World fun park in California\, every step of the way has been careful
 ly plotted. Except a few hundred hysterical exceptions. There’s never be
 en a family vacation like it. Except maybe yours. And that helps explain w
 hy National Lampoon’s Vacation remains so popular…and so very funny.\n
 \nAbout Floating Features\n\nSan Francisco Legacy Businesses Red and White
  Fleet and The Roxie are partnering to turn the hybrid electric vessel Enh
 ydra into a sailing cinema for a limited run of nighttime film cruises on 
 the Bay. Join us this autumn for a 2-hour twilight cruise and a feature fi
 lm handpicked by the Roxie. Our electric vessel means no engine noise and 
 a totally unique al fresco movie experience.\n\nFull schedule available he
 re.\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 38m\n\nYear\n\n1983\n\nDirector\n\nHarold Ramis\n\nFo
 rmat\n\nDCP\n\nFirst Showing\n\nDecember 12\, 2026\n\nCategories\n\nFloati
 ng Features\n\n\,\n\nFeatured\, Floating Features\n\nTickets: https://www.
 redandwhite.com/floating-features\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/20
 26/12/12/floating-features-national-lampoon-s-christmas-vacation-tickets\n
