 y Bebop at 6:30 pm\, followed by the feature film. Use #cyberpunkcinema du
 ring the event to share trivia\, thoughts or squishy human feelings on the
  HD projection screen.\n\nCyberpunk Cinema\nEvery second Monday at 6:30 pm
 \nThe Knockout\, 3223 Mission St.\, SF\nFREE\n– Updated 6/4/19 – Event
  info last checked via website\n\nUpcoming Cyberpunk Cinema Night | Missio
 n Dist. Events\nMon 10/12 Cyberpunk Cinema Night | Mission Dist.Mon 11/9 C
