DESCRIPTION:Ten years after her husband suddenly died\, Anna (Nicole Kidma
 n) has finally restarted her life and accepted a marriage proposal from he
 r boyfriend. At the engagement party\, a stranger wanders in to announce t
 hat he's Anna's dead husband. That stranger is a ten-year-old boy. Against
  her better judgment\, Anna decides to hear him out.\n\nArguably the apex 
 of a stretch of roles proving her to be the most adventurous movie star of
  her generation\, Nicole Kidman gives a pitch-perfect performance in the c
 hilly world Jonathan Glazer creates in BIRTH. (Mike Keegan)\n\n35mm print 
 courtesy of Park Circus\n\nTickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/weird-w
 ednesday-birth?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=23202\nDetails: https://dothebay.co
 m/events/2026/12/16/birth-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
