DESCRIPTION:Based on the humorous writings of author Jean Shepherd\, this 
 beloved holiday movie follows the wintry exploits of youngster Ralphie Par
 ker (Peter Billingsley)\, who spends most of his time dodging a bully (Zac
 k Ward) and dreaming of his ideal Christmas gift\, a “Red Ryder air rifl
 e.” Frequently at odds with his cranky dad (Darren McGavin) but comforte
 d by his doting mother (Melinda Dillon)\, Ralphie struggles to make it to 
 Christmas Day with his glasses and his hopes intact.\n\nAbout Floating Fea
 tures\n\nSan Francisco Legacy Businesses Red and White Fleet and The Roxie
  are partnering to turn the hybrid electric vessel Enhydra into a sailing 
 cinema for a limited run of nighttime film cruises on the Bay. Join us thi
 s autumn for a 2-hour twilight cruise and a feature film handpicked by the
  Roxie. Our electric vessel means no engine noise and a totally unique al 
 fresco movie experience.\n\nFull schedule available here.\n\nRuntime\n\n1h
  33m\n\nYear\n\n1983\n\nDirector\n\nBob Clark\n\nFormat\n\nDCP\n\nFirst Sh
 owing\n\nDecember 19\, 2026\n\nCategories\n\nFloating Features\n\n\,\n\nFe
 atured\, Floating Features\n\nTickets: https://www.redandwhite.com/floatin
 g-features\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/19/floating-featu
 res-a-christmas-story-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34022746/d3ff83de-c8be-456c-a433-ecf48b4aa6e3.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261020T194441Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/19/floating-features-a-christmas-s
 tory-tickets
